:: convo.VehVehSelf.thirdTime
{=

_line["Is it about my name again?"] She stands back, guarded. Last time, you reached an impasse at "Mahveh-Veh-//something//".
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"You don't want to talk your family name... Are you some kind of nobility?\"", "someNobility",
    "<!--B-->\"No, I just wanted to hear more about you.\"", "moreAbout",
))
<br>

<!--someNobility-->
[
_line["Yes,"] she scoffs. _line["Many city-dwelling imperials have some lord or lady in their family tree. Even the merchants' kids are pretending to be nobles. Mine's no major family, no-one involved with the Kuchkhan League, if //that's// what you're wondering."]
<br>
In other words, her family is not among the upstart ones with ill-blood towards the Reclaimer-Emperors. There goes one of your hypotheses.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Then why don't you want to talk about it? Are you self-conscious about being from a minor family?\"", "smallFamily",
    "<!--B-->\"So there's no reason to hide your name, is there? And things have normalized between the League and Nudankhan.\"", "noReason",
))
<br>
](someNobility|


<!--smallFamily-->
[
_line["Self-conscious... Yeah, let's say that,"] she sighs. It's clear that whatever you put forth now, she will assent.
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Just wanted to know more about you, is all.\"", "moreAbout",
))
<br>
](smallFamily|


<!--noReason-->
[
_line["Sure... normalized,"] she sighs. You wonder what stake she has in this century-old game among the ruling class. _line["Is there a reason why you're asking me about it?"]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Just wanted to know more about you, is all.\"", "moreAbout",
))
<br>
](noReason|


<!--moreAbout-->
[
_line["Is that what you're doing - getting to know me?"] The way she scoffs makes you feel ridiculous. Definitely nobility. _line["I'm more than happy to talk about anything else - my studies, for example. What inconsequential house I belong to simply isn't the most interesting thing about myself."]
<br>
($funcInnerConvo: (dm:
	"<!--A-->\"Understood.\"", "preDone1",
    "<!--B-->\"Apologies.\"", "preDone1",
    "<!--C-->\"...\"", "preDone1",
))
<br>
](moreAbout|


<!--preDone1-->
[
_line["I really enjoy meeting someone new, someone close to my station. So please, let's keep it pleasant and not place me where I'm not."]
<br>
$cssDesc[You should be double-wise and not bring this up again in a while.]
<br>
(t8n: "dissolve")(show: ?done)
](preDone1|